0, c0) such that the cup's bbox has a 1-cell gap from\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/3dc255db.py:294:    \"\"\"Boolean (H, W) mask of cells on the mouth side of ``bbox`` (opposite the tail direction),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/3dc255db.py:312:    \"\"\"With probability ``STRAY_PROB``, place an isolated pixel on the mouth side of one cup.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/3dc255db.py:341:    \"\"\"Build one cup (shape + placement + ejection line) and commit it to the canvases.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/3dc255db.py:387:    \"\"\"Place each cup's content_count pixels at random inside its mouth interior.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/3dc255db.py:402:    \"\"\"Single end-to-end generation attempt. Returns a valid input grid or None on failure.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/3dc255db.py:407:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/3dc255db.py:457:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/985ae207.py:81:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/985ae207.py:82:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/985ae207.py:97:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/985ae207.py:337:    \"\"\"Generate a single input grid for task 985ae207.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/985ae207.py:362:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/db118e2a.py:6:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/db118e2a.py:7:    \"\"\"Normalize the framed input motif into a 5x5 icon and stamp two copies on a 15x15 canvas.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/db118e2a.py:23:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/db118e2a.py:148:    \"\"\"Paint the non-corner border cells in-place.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/db118e2a.py:197:def generate_input():\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:7:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:8:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:22:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:216:    \"\"\"Return empty 4-neighbor cells inside the shape canvas.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:367:    \"\"\"Return True if any patch cell has a non-bg 8-neighbor on canvas.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:394:    \"\"\"Return True when a cell and its in-bounds 8-neighborhood are bg.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:509:    \"\"\"Choose grid size/background and return matching output/input canvases.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:519:    \"\"\"Place distinct isolated border anchors into both canvases.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:535:    \"\"\"Expand anchor colors to the sprite count, allowing repeated markers.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:545:    \"\"\"Build sprites in their solved locations and return their align metadata.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:564:    \"\"\"Move solved sprites onto the input canvas along the inverse axis.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:576:    \"\"\"Apply generator invariants and the solver oracle check.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/581f7754.py:582:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
